      <p class="story__text">
        A-BOX started as a simple idea: build a portable speaker that felt more like a small piece
        of equipment than a fragile consumer device inspired by netherlands brand Thodio.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text">
        From component sourcing to enclosure work, the project was an opportunity to practice building something from the ground up, with a focus on making it feel solid and durable in hand.
      </p>
