      <h2 class="story__title">Electronics</h2>
      <p class="story__text">
        Internal wiring, power management decisions and a small
        custom PCB to keep the final assembly cleaner.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text">
        It was an early but valuable exercise in making electronics physically robust, not just functional
        on a table.
      </p>
